SebType's own code, under the MIT licence in ../../LICENSE-SebType. The dictionary it builds,
android/app/src/main/res/raw/main_en.dict, is not: it is FUTO's dictionary with wordfreq's frequencies (see ../../NOTICE).
en_US.dict, which build.sh --aosp builds for the new keyboard (#244), is not SebType's code either: AOSP's
en_US word list (Apache-2.0) with wordfreq's frequencies (CC BY-SA 4.0) and SCOWL-checked words (see
../../NOTICE).
